# Gallery Compose 配置 / Gallery Compose configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 运行时选择（cpu / gpu / cuda），改完执行:
#     docker compose down && docker compose up -d
# Runtime selection (cpu / gpu / cuda); then run:
#     docker compose down && docker compose up -d
COMPOSE_PROFILES=cpu

# 媒体目录（可选）：本地磁盘任意绝对路径；不设置时使用默认值 ./media。
# 挂载目录即媒体库根目录，根目录下每个子文件夹识别为一个画师。
# 多个媒体目录：一行一个，最多 3 个（DIR2/DIR3 槽位已预置，空槽自动忽略）
# Media directory (optional): any local absolute path; unset falls back
# to ./media. The mounted directory becomes the library root; every
# subfolder inside is recognized as one artist. Multiple libraries:
# one line each, up to three (empty slots are ignored automatically).
# 示例 / examples:
#   GALLERY_MEDIA_DIR=D:\Pictures
#   GALLERY_MEDIA_DIR2=E:\Art
#   GALLERY_MEDIA_DIR=/home/user/pictures
# GALLERY_MEDIA_DIR=D:\Pictures
